  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROTECTION AND RESTORATION OF WINTERING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is located at two sites: in northwest Chihuahua and in central Durango. 35 waterfowl species have been recorded at Laguna de Santiaguillo. The project will protect 17,290 acres of wintering habitat in Durango and Chihuahua; 2) develop a management and restoration plan for 59, 345 acres at Santiaguillo Lagoon; manage, enhance or restore 2470 acres in Durango; restore and enhance 12 acres at the project sites in Chihuahua; and conduct biological monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
